WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
Solar panels produce electricity during daylight when the site conditions allow.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.200
The hybrid inverter manages solar, grid, battery and selected loads.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.800
The system design depends on energy needs, roof conditions and equipment selection.
